# Build / IDE / per-machine noise — common across all IceSpiritAI_* repos.
# Domain-specific rules (model staging, mirror staging, etc.) intentionally omitted
# for the initial Vision scaffold; add when needed.

# Per-machine ad-hoc test fixtures (real-device photos + transcriptions).
# 2026-08-21: never stage these — they contain real OCR captures and
# research notes that should stay local.
测试集/

# Knowledge base directory — large set of regulation PDFs / DOCX / WPS
# source files plus per-domain markdowns. 2026-09-02: not pushed to remote
# (体积大 + 含未授权转载的法源原文,本地留存供规则引擎引用即可)。
知识库/

# Historical release APK archive. The Gradle release pipeline no longer
# writes here as of 2026-08-21 (staging moved to build/generated/release-staging/),
# but the directory persists on disk with prior releases. Keep ignored so
# it doesn't pollute git status.
发布版历史存档/

